  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tMTD IT\n\t\tMTD IT FAQs\n\n### How to Add Client Authorisations to Your Agent Services Account\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Fri, 3 Jul, 2026 at 12:03 PM\n\n### How to add client authorisations to your Agent Services Account\n\n### Introduction\n\n### Why You Need an Agent Services Account\n\nAn Agent Services Account is required to connect your software to HMRC, sign up clients, and manage their records. Client authorisation must be held within this account. This is separate from your Online Services for Agents account, however authorisations can be added from one to the other.\n\n### Steps to Add Authorisations\n\nSign in to your Agent Services Account using the Government Gateway ID created when the account was set up.\n\nOn the welcome page, select \"Add existing Self Assessment authorisations to this account.\"\n\nYou will see a list of client authorisations already added, including the Agent Code used and the date added.\n\nTo add further client authorisations, select \"Add Agent Code.\"\n\nEnter the Agent Code for the client authorisations you wish to add, then select \"Continue.\"\n\nSign in using the Government Gateway ID associated with the Online Services for Agents account for that Agent Code.\n\n### Confirmation\n\nOnce complete, you will receive confirmation that all client authorisations under that agent code have been successfully added. You can then proceed to sign up your clients for Making Tax Digital for Income Tax.\n\n### For more info please refer the below\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a6Ewg6NR0hU&t=16s\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000118618\">MTD IT</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000202221\">MTD IT FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How to Add Client Authorisations to Your Agent Services Account\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Fri, 3 Jul, 2026 at 12:03 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<h1 style=\"margin-bottom: 4pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 27px; font-family: &quot;Calibri Light&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(47, 84, 150); font-weight: normal; text-align: center;\"><strong>How to add client authorisations to your Agent Services Account</strong></h1><p><br></p><h2 style=\"margin-bottom: 4pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 21px; font-family: &quot;Calibri Light&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(47, 84, 150); font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Introduction</strong></h2><p><br></p><h3 style=\"margin-bottom: 4pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 19px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(47, 84, 150); font-weight: normal;\">Why You Need an Agent Services Account</h3><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">An Agent Services Account is required to connect your software to HMRC, sign up clients, and manage their records. Client authorisation must be held within this account. This is separate from your Online Services for Agents account, however authorisations can be added from one to the other.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><br></p><h3 style=\"margin-bottom: 4pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 19px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(47, 84, 150); font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Steps to Add Authorisations</strong></h3><p><br></p><ol start=\"1\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in;\" type=\"1\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Sign in to your Agent Services Account using the Government Gateway ID created when the account was set up.</li></ol><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0.25in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><img width=\"623\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9250762348/original/sVBNWyyvyxRFZCxdior12Bnr5wwDi39smA.png?1782827035\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9250762348\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></p><ol start=\"2\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in;\" type=\"1\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">On the welcome page, select \"Add existing Self Assessment authorisations to this account.\"</li></ol><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0.25in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><img width=\"625\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9250762352/original/EXSVCshIEHprB0MF6H1lq3908boVNs16Tw.png?1782827035\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9250762352\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></p><ol start=\"3\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in;\" type=\"1\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">You will see a list of client authorisations already added, including the Agent Code used and the date added.</li></ol><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><img width=\"625\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9250762347/original/jeujB8TLCE3zX7TBUlfp9FMg57fglhCX3A.png?1782827035\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9250762347\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></p><ol start=\"4\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in;\" type=\"1\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">To add further client authorisations, select \"Add Agent Code.\"</li></ol><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0.25in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><img width=\"624\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9250762353/original/J09DrfntqMJ6DoZYdY0SXlraHKQmUKRGNQ.png?1782827035\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9250762353\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></p><ol start=\"5\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in;\" type=\"1\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Enter the Agent Code for the client authorisations you wish to add, then select \"Continue.\"</li></ol><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><img width=\"624\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9250762351/original/VFZOarh546VsWj2efDomG3nKu6RKg9uxoQ.png?1782827035\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9250762351\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></p><ol start=\"6\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0in;\" type=\"1\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Sign in using the Government Gateway ID associated with the Online Services for Agents account for that Agent Code.</li></ol><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><img width=\"624\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9250762349/original/dns-B57EzhO-QGctbN75MywOg3djVGsDIw.png?1782827035\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9250762349\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></p><h3 style=\"margin-bottom: 4pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 19px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(47, 84, 150); font-weight: normal;\">Confirmation</h3><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Once complete, you will receive confirmation that all client authorisations under that agent code have been successfully added. You can then proceed to sign up your clients for Making Tax Digital for Income Tax.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><img width=\"623\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9250762350/original/7XsWwpx1oemq4Ay04bfQitOFAs2HRCyVFA.png?1782827035\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9250762350\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></p><h3 style=\"margin-bottom: 4pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 19px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(47, 84, 150); font-weight: normal;\">For more info please refer the below<br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a6Ewg6NR0hU&amp;t=16s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a6Ewg6NR0hU&amp;t=16s</a></h3><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000277529\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000277529/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000277529\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000277529/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000277529\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo</span></span></p><a class=\"hide a-link\" id=\"vote-feedback-form-link\" data-hide-dom=\"#vote-feedback-form-link\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">Send feedback</a><div id=\"vote-feedback-container\"class=\"hide\">\t<div class=\"lead\">Sorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.</